    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know about the hotlines. they dont get it. it's not just being sad, it's the shame. everyone i know is doing well, and here i am, a total disaster. i can see the look in their eyes already, even if they try to hide it. the descent is just so slow and humiliating. i just want the falling to stop. i'm tired of waiting for the impact.",
