      "content": "it's just hard to believe in \"worth\" when everything that made me who i was is gone. the people i worked with, the life i built... it's all a joke now. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be to just step out of the story before it gets even more embarrassing. like, wouldn't it be better to leave while i still have some shred of myself left, rather than waiting to hit the absolute bottom where i'm just a laughingstock?",
